OL,3,GNEWSAPier premiere celebrates film
OL,4,Abefore Prime release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town has turned out in force to
OL,7,Fsupport a 19-year-old film-maker ahead
OL,8,Fof his new film being released on a
OL,9,Fmajor streaming platform.
OL,11,FRupert Harold from Cromer in Norfolk
OL,12,Fhas made his second feature film and
OL,13,Fhas set his sights on becoming the
OL,14,Fyoungest director to win an Oscar.
OL,16,FHis film, Crecista, is a rags to riches
OL,17,Fstory filmed across locations in
OL,18,FNorfolk, Lake Como, Milan and Naples
OL,19,Fand features helicopters, sports cars
OL,20,Fand a yacht, all within a #2,000
OL,21,Fbudget. The film will be streamed on
OL,22,FAmazon Prime.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
